{
  "issue": "I032-P2-5",
  "scope": "第一批 10 个核心公式；其余公式待后续批次，不宣称全覆盖或屏幕阅读器兼容性已验收",
  "records": [
    {
      "page": "chapter01_measurable_spaces.html",
      "anchor": "theorem-1-3-3",
      "math_index": 1,
      "label": "由域 A 生成的单调系 m(A) 等于由 A 生成的 sigma 域。",
      "presentation_sha256": "8e0fc321e2bb1a50a4e33dbe4d9c9676ca7749460f29e2b45346ea8119c0ba95"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter01_measurable_spaces.html",
      "anchor": "theorem-1-5-5-proof",
      "math_index": 1,
      "label": "s_n(x) 等于 2 的 n 次方乘 min(f(x),n) 后向下取整，再除以 2 的 n 次方。",
      "presentation_sha256": "a96d784ba4a8ef4178e49371eaabf8f5d0f626669c5b5d4c3599a268efc4097f"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter02_measure_spaces.html",
      "anchor": "theorem-2-1-5",
      "math_index": 0,
      "label": "A_n 上升到 A 时，mu(A_n) 上升到 mu(A)；A_n 下降到 A 且 mu(A_1) 有限时，mu(A_n) 下降到 mu(A)。",
      "presentation_sha256": "3d1548297fd0fd77dbb0052e16c0e1d49b89dd9b9627eee17d8b0c687718421f"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter02_measure_spaces.html",
      "anchor": "theorem-2-2-1",
      "math_index": 0,
      "label": "tau(A) 是所有可数 E 成员 B_n 覆盖 A 的总费用 sum mu(B_n) 的下确界。",
      "presentation_sha256": "80c7121a994b74a7883536037aa8159cf8f415bc412efc63cd56d30f40a2423f"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter03_integration.html",
      "anchor": "theorem-3-2-4-proof",
      "math_index": 11,
      "label": "g_k 的积分不超过 f_k 的积分，不超过 f 的积分；g_k 的积分极限等于 f 的积分，积分均对 mu。",
      "presentation_sha256": "8d0c359563c43c60eb67675ea5847576a15d0d073d4da5129d34418f1237b218"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter03_integration.html",
      "anchor": "theorem-3-2-6-proof",
      "math_index": 5,
      "label": "积分 liminf f_n 等于 lim_k 积分 g_k，不超过 lim_k inf_{n大于等于k} 积分 f_n，积分均对 mu。",
      "presentation_sha256": "d4804ff88ea21dc78511ce1759dd4450453609dae78801c3bca0320ef147df02"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter03_integration.html",
      "anchor": "theorem-3-3-4-proof",
      "math_index": 5,
      "label": "N_p(f+g) 的 p 次方，不超过积分 |f|乘|f+g|的 p−1 次方加积分 |g|乘|f+g|的 p−1 次方，不超过 [N_p(f)+N_p(g)]乘 N_p(f+g)的 p−1 次方。",
      "presentation_sha256": "ffbb243d572c99a8f35adf8fa0961acd063e007c4328fe0eb792e374b8d72338"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter03_integration.html",
      "anchor": "theorem-3-4-2-proof",
      "math_index": 2,
      "label": "|f| 的 s 次方的期望，不超过 (|f| 的 t 次方的期望)的 s/t 次方乘(E1)的 1−s/t 次方，等于 (|f| 的 t 次方的期望)的 s/t 次方。",
      "presentation_sha256": "d8f2ac7f1de667611e06f354e6f2f226fb872f06e51d3966642c72092f0f687b"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter04_signed_measures.html",
      "anchor": "theorem-4-3-5-proof",
      "math_index": 5,
      "label": "phi(A) 等于各 n 的 phi(A 交 A_n)之和，等于各块 A 交 A_n 上 f_n 对 mu 积分之和，等于 A 上 f 对 mu 的积分。",
      "presentation_sha256": "d866712a9bb39f9a552b308ef8c8f45a21aaeb225878797136c7c0a00ee6ef03"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter04_signed_measures.html",
      "anchor": "definition-4-5-1",
      "math_index": 4,
      "label": "对每个 G 中的事件 A，A 上条件期望 E(f|G) 对 P 的积分，等于 A 上 f 对 P 的积分。",
      "presentation_sha256": "b9aaec85ebc12a9d991d64c4167ac514cf32a305b3e486e6f5dde05641034c15"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter05_product_spaces.html",
      "anchor": "kernel-joint-mass",
      "label": "集合 E 的联合质量 Q，等于对第一坐标测度积分核 p 在截面 E 下标 x 上的质量。",
      "presentation_sha256": "ba43d912f2386a6afc3296653e44f3ee77cc0794a90a9570e4edaa118bd4cef1"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter05_product_spaces.html",
      "anchor": "multivariate-increment",
      "label": "矩形增量由各顶点函数值按正负交替求和，要求结果非负。",
      "presentation_sha256": "e1a0c8c216089b9520239fafb5c1f3c23347f22c30604cc785e59fe64d10f7aa"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter06_independent_sequences.html",
      "anchor": "characteristic-inversion",
      "label": "分布函数左右极限平均在 b 与 a 的差，等于特征函数反演积分的极限，系数为二 pi 的倒数。",
      "presentation_sha256": "0205b852d68cb642e4fb046694dc6923245acd39bac2379cb505ec8e87448785"
    },
    {
      "page": "chapter06_independent_sequences.html",
      "anchor": "lindeberg-condition",
      "label": "每个固定正 epsilon 下，大于 epsilon 倍总标准差的中心化平方尾矩之和，除以总方差，趋于零。",
      "presentation_sha256": "4914b4d2d36ca942d525a8af3ac3df9f5a28dc56c60fa95bd8ad8db4eb9703bc"
    }
  ],
